:"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Heino","x":"Accordingly, we suspended our guidance and announced a number of cost saving measures intended to mitigate the economic impact to our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LNTH 2020 Q2","e":"lnth","d":"2020-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Marshall Jr.","x":"As a reminder, we have reduced salaries and hours as appropriate for all team members, implemented a hiring freeze on planned additions and realized a reduction in promotional expenditure, travel and entertainment expenses among other initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/30/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q2-2020-earnings-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"LNTH 2020 Q3","e":"lnth","d":"2020-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Heino","x":"One of them is the pass-through application to CMS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2020 Q3","e":"lnth","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Marshall","x":"Those are the places that we're finding cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2020 Q3","e":"lnth","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Raj Denhoy","x":"Next year again I realize that the timing constraints around the FDA approval process, but just trying to rightsize how to think about this next year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q3-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2020 Q4","e":"lnth","d":"2021-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Heino","x":"With the -- with a pet based diagnostic product, you applied to what's called pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2020 Q4","e":"lnth","d":"2021-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Heino","x":"So for all intents and purposes, we're assuming that our application goes in on the September one date, which means that we would have the pass-through in place by Jan 1, 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2020 Q4","e":"lnth","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Marshall","x":"We're going to be putting back some of the cost savings initiatives that we had put in place in '21 -- excuse me, in 2020 and Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/26/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q4-2020-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q1","e":"lnth","d":"2021-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Heino","x":"This timing aligns with the expected approval of our pass-through application with the Center for Medicare and Medicaid Services or CMS, for Medicare coverage in the hospital outpatient setting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q1","e":"lnth","d":"2021-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Richard Newitter","x":"…timelines that you kind of laid out in the past relative if there were to be some delays here with the pass-through submission and and what it would take for you to build out a commercial infrastructure do still kind of meet some of those targets even if there were a delay by a few months?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q1-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q2","e":"lnth","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Blanchfield","x":"We remain on track with our internal time lines for obtaining appropriate coding, pass-through status and progress with commercial payers related to ensure appropriate coverage and payment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q2","e":"lnth","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Blanchfield","x":"The first part was related to PMF activation and our rollout plans and the second related to our CMS pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q2","e":"lnth","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Marshall Jr.","x":"Additionally, it's also worth noting that the company had enacted a number of cost savings initiatives in the prior year quarter to counter the impacts of COVID-19 on our financials, which drives some unfavorability in comparison with spend normalization in the current year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q2-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q3","e":"lnth","d":"2021-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Blanchfield","x":"We have been particularly pleased with the adoption by hospitals, much of which is in the hospital outpatient setting, even prior to pass-through payment initiation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q3","e":"lnth","d":"2021-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Blanchfield","x":"Regarding market access, specifically coverage coding and payment, we submitted our pass-through application to the Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services or CMS during the third quarter, and we expect pass-through payment to go into effect January 1st, 2022, which aligns well, with our…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q3","e":"lnth","d":"2021-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Blanchfield","x":"During the quarter, we also received notification, that our HCPCS code, which enables streamline billing, will be effective as of January 1st, 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q3","e":"lnth","d":"2021-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Blanchfield","x":"Again, this is the benefit of having a diversified revenue stream, that we can continue to demonstrate strong growth, and be able to have an opportunity to raise our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2021 Q3","e":"lnth","d":"2021-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Danielle Antalffy","x":"I wanted to get into guidance a little bit, and you're raising guidance by, I think, about $9 million at the midpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/07/lantheus-holdings-inc-lnth-q3-2021-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"LNTH 2025 Q4","e":"lnth","d":"2026-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Heino","x":"A central tenet of our launch strategy is to ensure we have coding, transitional pass-through status, and broad payer coverage in place before commercial launch, thereby ensuring customers have access to and coverage for the new formulation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/lantheus-lnth-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LNTH 2025 Q4","e":"lnth","d":"2026-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mary Anne Heino","x":"…and strong nuclear medicine customer relationships, our goal is to ensure the transition from PYLARIFY to our new formulation will be a seamless experience while providing what will be the only F-18-based product in the PSMA imaging category with transitional pass-through reimbursement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/lantheus-lnth-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LNTH 2026 Q1","e":"lnth","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Amanda Morgan","x":"We have submitted our application for a HIC6 code and are preparing to apply for transitional pass-through status.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/lantheus-lnth-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LNTH 2026 Q1","e":"lnth","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Marshall","x":"We still have one competitor who is maybe find some footing with their new products, launch themselves as well as one that will be losing pass-through later this year, call it, October 1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/lantheus-lnth-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LNTH 2026 Q1","e":"lnth","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Marshall","x":"Our first quarter results underscore the disciplined execution of our strategic priorities and commitment to streamlining our cost structure to drive operational efficiencies, enabling us to support sustainable long-term value creation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/lantheus-lnth-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LNTH 2026 Q1","e":"lnth","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Matthew Taylor","x":"But would you have raised guidance if not for that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/lantheus-lnth-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,7152,0,0,0,5572,1182],[37,1,4933,0,0,0,3940,709],[38,1,4883,0,0,0,3972,621],[39,1,4347,0,0,0,3871,297],[40,1,4611,0,0,0,4232,114],[41,1,3736,0,0,0,3319,234],[42,1,6062,0,0,0,5191,594],[43,1,6013,0,0,0,5192,584],[44,1,7444,0,0,0,6620,462],[45,1,7973,0,0,0,7061,635],[46,1,8466,0,0,0,7055,1082],[47,1,7624,0,0,0,6459,868],[64,1,8997,0,0,0,7673,887],[65,1,6794,0,0,0,5757,770]],"cinema":